// Back to the Max plan: undoes api-lane.patch.json5, on Adam's word of 2026-11-16 ("switch it to the
// max plan now"). Preview with --dry-run first. No secret involved: the key stays stored, unused by
// main and deep.
//
// What moves to Max (the claude-cli runtime, Jorah's Claude login in ~/.claude-jorah):
//   - main: chat, voice, the iPhone app, heartbeat, Dreaming and the utility model (agents.defaults);
//   - deep: its own model entry from front.patch.json5 pinned it to the embedded runtime, so it is
//     repinned here. deep needs no shell, and claude-cli turns get only OpenClaw's tools through the
//     MCP bridge, which still pass before_tool_call (jorah-guard, jorah-github).
// What stays on the API key, and why:
//   - background: its whole job is shell in OpenClaw's Podman sandbox, which only the embedded
//     runtime gives; on claude-cli its exec fails closed (measured 2026-11-06). background.patch.json5
//     pins it to "openclaw", and its per-agent auth order keeps anthropic:jorah-store.
// Claude Code coding jobs (ACP) were already on Max.
// Usage on claude-cli draws from the signed-in subscription's limits (OpenClaw docs,
// providers/anthropic.md), the same weekly limits as Adam's own Claude Code if it is the same account.
// Undo: api-lane.patch.json5, plus deep's entry back to { agentRuntime: { id: "openclaw" } }.
{
  auth: { order: { anthropic: [] } },
  agents: {
    defaults: {
      models: {
        "anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5": { agentRuntime: { id: "claude-cli" } },
        "anthropic/claude-opus-5-5": { agentRuntime: { id: "claude-cli" } },
        "anthropic/claude-opus-5": { agentRuntime: { id: "claude-cli" } },
        "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5-5": { agentRuntime: { id: "claude-cli" } },
        "anthropic/claude-sonnet-5": { agentRuntime: { id: "claude-cli" } },
        "anthropic/claude-fable-5-1": { agentRuntime: { id: "claude-cli" } },
        "anthropic/claude-fable-5": { agentRuntime: { id: "claude-cli" } },
        "anthropic/claude-opus-4-7": { agentRuntime: { id: "claude-cli" } },
        "anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-6": { agentRuntime: { id: "claude-cli" } },
        "anthropic/claude-opus-4-6": { agentRuntime: { id: "claude-cli" } },
        "anthropic/*": { agentRuntime: { id: "claude-cli" } },
      },
    },
    entries: {
      deep: {
        models: { "anthropic/claude-opus-5-5": { agentRuntime: { id: "claude-cli" } } },
      },
    },
  },
}
